25: /**
26:  * The governed pipelines every loop mode runs through (SPEC 0181 §4). The
27:  * single-turn loop and the iterative loop both call these functions, so policy,
28:  * approval, guards, pause, cancellation, the log and the effect ledger live in
29:  * one implementation.
30:  */
